\textbf{Situational Archetypes (6):} Exploration (early research, low intent, high curiosity), Consideration (active evaluation, medium intent), Decision (ready to purchase, high intent), Crisis (negative sentiment, competitive threat), Opportunity (surge demand, trending alignment), Retention (post-purchase, loyalty).

